--TEST--
the attribute names a `Core` class, which is declared outside the workspace, so renaming it is refused, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Blog
{
    #[Core\Ro<|>ute(path: "/", method: Core\Http\Method::Get)]
    public static function index(): string
    {
        return "hello";
    }
}
--REQUEST--
rename to=Path
--EXPECT--
refused: `Core\Route` is declared outside this workspace, so it cannot be renamed.
